{"id":"conclusio_n","lemma":"conclusión","pos":"noun","rank":2786,"glosses":["conclusion, end","completion","finding"],"ipa":"/konkluˈsjon/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"conclusiones"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/1d/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-conclusi%C3%B3n.wav","examples":[{"text":"¿Cómo llegaste a esa conclusión?","en":"How do you come to that conclusion?","words":[{"g":"how"},{"g":"to arrive, get","l":"llegar"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"that","l":"ese"},null]},{"text":"¿Se ha llegado a alguna conclusión?","en":"Has any conclusion been reached?","words":[{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"arrived"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"someone","l":"alguno"},null]},{"text":"Así es como llegamos a la conclusión.","en":"This is how we reached the conclusion.","words":[null,null,{"g":"as"},{"g":"to arrive, get","l":"llegar"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"the / her"},null],"phrases":[[0,2,"so it is: so it goes"]]},{"text":"La conclusión es clara como el cristal.","en":"The conclusion is crystal clear.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"the white"},{"g":"as"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"crystal"}]},{"text":"He llegado a la conclusión de que él es culpable.","en":"I have come to the conclusion that he is guilty.","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"arrived"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"the / her"},null,null,null,{"g":"he"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"guilty, culpable"}],"phrases":[[5,7,"that"]]}]}